Z||000003||87GTZ34||06-01-2001||05:35 PM||||Gts, I assume the eng is a 2.8.  What other mods does it have/are you planning and what are your goals for it?  What trans are you planning to run the power thru?  Once you have all of this info, you can plan accordingly.  For my stocker, I just wanted a 2.8 that is running as strong as possible for a stocker.  Modifying the heads would be a waste of my money as the 'rest' of engine would be able to take advantage of a ported, 5 angle valve job with higher ratio rockers and stiffer springs and lighter/stronger valves.||||reg||1
